          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; constraints (Page 1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. USER_SETTINGS.user_id and MAIN_PROFILES.user_id are UNIQUE (UQ) and NOT NULL &amp;rarr; APP_USERS 1:1 with each. APP_USERS participation is partial (a user may exist before the profile/settings row is created).&lt;br&gt;2. PROJECT_STORIES.project_id is UNIQUE &amp;rarr; a project has 0..1 story; every story belongs to exactly one project.&lt;br&gt;3. All other FKs are NOT NULL &amp;rarr; the child side participates totally (double line). PORTFOLIO_VERSIONS.template_id is assumed required.&lt;br&gt;4. PORTFOLIO_CONTENT_SELECTIONS.content_id is a &lt;b&gt;polymorphic&lt;/b&gt; reference: together with content_type it points to a row in PROFILE_EDUCATIONS, PROFILE_EXPERIENCES, PROFILE_SKILLS or PROFILE_PROJECTS. It is &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; a FK, so no relationship is drawn for it.&lt;br&gt;5. Previewing a portfolio renders PORTFOLIO_VERSIONS + selections + sections live; it stores nothing. Publishing (Page 2) creates an immutable PORTFOLIO_PUBLICATIONS snapshot." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="page-core-1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1978" width="1150" height="254" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
