        <mxCell id="p2_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; constraints (Page 2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Entities marked &quot;(see Page 1)&quot; are the same entities as on Page 1, repeated with their PK only.&lt;br&gt;2. PORTFOLIO_PUBLICATIONS rows are &lt;b&gt;immutable snapshots&lt;/b&gt;. Republishing a version inserts a new row with the next revision_number; (version_id, revision_number) is unique. Rows are never updated or deleted.&lt;br&gt;3. Unpublishing sets unpublished_at on the publication and PORTFOLIO_PUBLIC_ACCESS.is_active = false; the historical snapshot stays.&lt;br&gt;4. PORTFOLIO_PUBLIC_ACCESS.publication_id is UNIQUE &amp;rarr; a publication has 0..1 access record. public_slug is UNIQUE.&lt;br&gt;5. AUDIT_EVENTS.entity_type / entity_id are a generic (polymorphic) reference to any audited row. They are &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; a FK, so no relationship is drawn.&lt;br&gt;6. All drawn FKs are NOT NULL &amp;rarr; the child side participates totally (double line)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="page-publish-1">
